是对方锦舒不断刻意挑衅。方锦舒终于认清现实，离开渣男后，她转身奔赴家族安排的联姻，意外邂逅属于自己的真爱，开启崭新人生篇章。而宋梵宇最终也为自己的背叛付出了代价！","series_id":"7509784190171221016","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233040BA8EE3307499589B933B\",\"rank\":\"5\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7509784190171221016\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.02517884224653244,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":0.9645574688911438,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.08602434396743774,\\\"finish\\\":0.0015487609198316932,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.06272276490926743,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7216811180114746,\\\"like\\\":0.04401865601539612}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7509784190171221016","play_cnt":13432,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"一簇花似锦","sub_title":"爱情·都市爱情","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":60,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5061,\"name\":\"都市爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5061&categoryName=都市爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5161,\"name\":\"替身文学\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5161&categoryName=替身文学&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5104,\"name\":\"日久生情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5104&categoryName=日久生情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5206,\"name\":\"总裁\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5206&categoryName=总裁&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5338,\"name\":\"现代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5338&categoryName=现代&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"}]","color_dominate":"#382018","horiz_cover":"","sub_title_list":[{"content":"爱情","data_type":3},{"content":"1680万热度","data_type":27}],"pay_info":{},"support_listen":false,"recommend_reason_list":"{\"sub_title_list\":[{\"content\":\"爱情\",\"data_type\":3},{\"content\":\"1680万热度\",\"data_type\":27}]}"}],"category_tag_ids":null,"style":{"cover_size":0,"interval_type":0,"use_wide_item_space":false,"use_new_booklist_style":false,"with_favorite_button":false,"show_more_book_abstract":false,"candidate_postion":0,"jump_to_page":0,"topic_square_with_book":false,"use_aweme_sdk":false,"use_new_one_to_one_point_four_ratio_style":false,"hide_tab_selector":false,"audio_both_jump_player":false,"show_username":false,"use_selector_v2":false,"video_inner_next_item":0},"group_id_type":9,"cell_long_press_action":{"type":0},"cell_item_source_info":{"item_source":1},"ai_search_placeholder":null,"push_start_info":null,"book_hot_content_data":null},{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7475217114601638937","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/2256cd0b70b99bbfb91dde49708d455c~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799163042&x-signature=sa8AT33s6U34FM2ml5OfUx2Pbl4%3D","duration":6770,"title":"只需待我如初心","video_desc":"十年前，陆升是富家少爷，风光无限，身边不乏追求者，虞芷溪则是贫穷拮据的校花。陆升对虞芷溪一见钟情，为追求她，包下其奶奶医药费，让她留在自己身边工作。可陆家突遭变故，陆升无奈选择离开。十年后，虞芷溪凭借自身努力成为女总裁，意外发现陆升成了这里的服务员。虞芷溪公司遇危机，陆升带着专利相助，两人过往误会逐渐解开，感情再度升温。","series_id":"7475178956895816766","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233040BA8EE3307499589B933B\",\"rank\":\"6\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7475178956895816766\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.10215643793344498,\\\"finish\\\":0.001987774157896638,\\\"collect\\\":0.03161877393722534,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.0393972396850586,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.725922167301178,\\\"like\\\":0.04603390023112297